    "title": "Portland City Council rejects cut to homeless camp sweep funding - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Spencer Schacht FOX 12 Staff ,\n3 hours ago PORTLAND Ore. (KPTV) - The Portland City Council rejected a proposal on Wednesday to cut funding from a program that clears homeless camps from public spaces. Councilor Angelita Morillo introduced an amendment that would have cut more than $4 million from multiple departments that help with the sweeps of homeless camps and redirected $2 million of that money to food assistance and housing grants. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
